WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:03.390
- [Narrator] Rates of RSV or
Respiratory Syncytial Virus,

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:05.130
have been surging since August.

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:07.380
That's weeks earlier
than the typical season.

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:10.260
- Pediatric hospitals are
pretty stretched right now.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:12.570
- [Narrator] So doctors
are warning of a possible-

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:13.740
- Triple-demic.

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:16.230
That means cases of Covid, flu, and RSV,

00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:18.240
a virus that's been impacting children,

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:20.100
are all expected to rise.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:21.630
- [Narrator] Here's what
to know about the surge

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:24.851
in RSV and what it means for your winter.

00:00:24.851 --> 00:00:27.690
RSV is a virus spread through droplets

00:00:27.690 --> 00:00:30.360
from coughing and
sneezing, and on surfaces.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:32.490
It's so common, that nearly all children

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:34.980
come in contact with the
virus by the age of two.

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:37.980
And while RSV feels like
a cold for most people,

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:41.040
it can be severe for some
infants and older adults.

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:43.920
According to the CDC,
about 58,000 children

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:47.250
under five are hospitalized
due to RSV every year.

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:48.510
In pre-Covid times,

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:50.252
hospitalizations looked like this,

00:00:50.252 --> 00:00:52.470
peaking in January.

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:56.160
But in the first year of the
pandemic, RSV rates flattened.

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:57.900
That's because Covid safety measures,

00:00:57.900 --> 00:00:59.730
like distancing and face masks,

00:00:59.730 --> 00:01:02.700
also likely protected
people from other diseases.

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:06.840
But around the summer of
2021, cases of RSV shot up.

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:08.610
- [Brianna] Once you sort
of start mingling again

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:10.350
and dropping those restrictions,

00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:12.510
you get a lot of cases happening at once.

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:14.609
- [Narrator] There's no
approved vaccine for RSV,

00:01:14.609 --> 00:01:16.695
and children who didn't
get sick from the virus

00:01:16.695 --> 00:01:21.030
in 2020 or 2021, might have
less immunity protection.

00:01:21.030 --> 00:01:22.500
And for this fall surge-

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:24.240
- [Brianna] There's a
couple things at play here.

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:26.850
One of them sort of
being that a lot of kids

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:28.500
have gone back to school in the fall,

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:31.797
and this year there was
significantly less masking

00:01:31.797 --> 00:01:34.170
in a lot of schools and
other safety precautions

00:01:34.170 --> 00:01:35.820
that there were for the past two years.

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:37.500
There's been less exposure.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:40.010
Some of, like, the tiniest kids

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:44.385
haven't seen RSV before, and
so you have sort of a higher

00:01:44.385 --> 00:01:48.142
susceptible population
among sort of the youngest.

00:01:48.142 --> 00:01:50.670
- [Narrator] This surge
in RSV comes at a time

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:51.981
when other respiratory illnesses,

00:01:51.981 --> 00:01:54.810
like the Rhinovirus and Enteroviruses

00:01:54.810 --> 00:01:57.270
have increased
hospitalizations in children.

00:01:57.270 --> 00:01:59.820
So doctors are bracing for more cases.

00:01:59.820 --> 00:02:01.910
- The Connecticut Children's
Medical Center in Hartford

00:02:01.910 --> 00:02:04.590
is considering setting up a field hospital

00:02:04.590 --> 00:02:06.570
in case things get worse.

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:07.980
- [Narrator] And some
physicians are worried

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:10.620
about precautionary measures
for high risk infants.

00:02:10.620 --> 00:02:12.500
- Vulnerable babies, as a precaution,

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:15.210
get injections of this monoclonal antibody

00:02:15.210 --> 00:02:17.170
during the normal respiratory season.

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:21.385
But if, you know, RSV strikes
earlier or during the summer,

00:02:21.385 --> 00:02:24.240
like, a lot of those
babies, unless hospitals

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:26.310
sort of can anticipate
and keep up quickly,

00:02:26.310 --> 00:02:28.890
sort of lose that extra protection.

00:02:28.890 --> 00:02:30.450
- [Narrator] It's not just RSV.

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:33.540
The flu season arrived earlier
than usual this year, too.

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:35.340
- [Brianna] There is a lack of exposure,

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:38.250
because less people have had
it for the past two seasons,

00:02:38.250 --> 00:02:40.560
lower vaccination rates,
because, you know,

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:43.860
that's sort of a better
way to build up exposure.

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:46.230
Less precautions as people are heading

00:02:46.230 --> 00:02:50.370
inside and into schools
and workplaces again.

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:52.650
- [Narrator] And that,
combined with a possible uptick

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:55.830
in Covid cases, has doctors
worried about a triple threat

00:02:55.830 --> 00:02:58.050
of RSV, Covid and flu.

00:02:58.050 --> 00:03:01.422
- A confluence of all of these
viruses could put hospitals

00:03:01.422 --> 00:03:03.360
under serious strain this winter,

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:05.092
because over the last two winters,

00:03:05.092 --> 00:03:08.040
hospitals were completely slammed

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:10.410
entirely just with Covid.

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:11.760
And what we saw during the pandemic,

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:13.560
is that if a hospital is overrun,

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:16.500
it's harder to get in for
any other sort of care

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:17.670
that you might need.

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:19.950
An overwhelmed hospital
isn't good for anybody.

00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:21.777
- [Narrator] To help
reduce hospital capacity,

00:03:21.777 --> 00:03:23.850
health officials are encouraging people

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:26.193
to get their flu and Covid vaccines.

